docs: describe client posture and reconnect behaviour

Document what the client sends (clientPosture, clientTouch), how Auto mode
decides, the live /posture sync and the safety rules of the automatic resume
(60 s cooldown, 5 s startup guard, no loops, only on a touch-class change).

